Source: spellbk.inc
     1 				; Dictionary table access for the spell checker. Lives at $9300, outside the $4000-$7FFF window of the
     2 				; 130XE extended bank, so it stays visible while the bank is switched in. Interrupts are masked
     3 				; (NMIEN off) while the bank is mapped because the code at $4000-$4BFF is hidden then.
     4
     5 65E8			 org DNM
     6 1450-1459> 44 31 3A 45 +  dta c'D1:EN.CDC',b($9B)
     7 145A			 org DNM2
     8 1470-1478> 48 3A 45 4E +  dta c'H:EN.CDC',b($9B)
     9
